  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Graduation-Based Social Protection Project (GBSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nearly 80% of Cambodia&#x2019;s poor population resides in rural areas, where they are predominantly engaged in subsistence farming. Almost all of the agricultural output they produce is used for household consumption and is highly vulnerable to weather extremes, economic and family shocks. The overall vision of the project is to build institutional capacity both at the central and sub-national level to implement the national Graduation Based Social Protection (GBSP) program and support a durable pathw</narrative>
  </description>
